# Decision X12 (report 028): the home grid's status strip with a power_supply battery (the harness's fake tree, command
# "battery": the tablet's BAT1 and ADP1), discharging, charging, full, low with Bluetooth off, then no battery at all
# (no battery drawn, as on the Pi boards). The tablet at 1280x800 has its own density (8.42 px/mm).
# Review only: no golden.
title battery status strip
review
sizes 320x170 480x320 640x480 800x480 1280x800
@1280x800 ppmm 842
apps Settings Store CLI SSH Calculator
clock 20:30
wifi 70
bt on
battery 85 discharging
home
shot battery_discharging
battery 42 charging
wait 2100
shot battery_charging
battery 100 full
wait 2100
shot battery_full
battery 7 discharging
bt off
wait 2100
shot battery_low_bt_off
battery off
bt on
wait 2100
shot battery_none
